  "openapi": "3.0.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "Cisco-IOS-XE-chassis-rpc - RPC Operations",
    "description": "Added facility to set chassis number and priority.\n     Copyright (c) 2021-2022 by Cisco Systems, Inc.\n     All rights reserved.\n\n**Module:** `Cisco-IOS-XE-chassis-rpc`\n**Version:** 2022-11-01\n**Operations:** 2",
